{"seq":1,"slug":"military-theory","title":"军事理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"军事理论\">军事理论</h1><p>军事理论是高校公共军事课的理论支柱，回答&quot;为什么要国防、靠什么观念建军、当代战争怎么打&quot;这一组根本问题。本 hub 不讲武器参数、不讲条文细则，而是讲<strong>思想、观念与战争形态</strong>——它是理解军事科学其余分支的&quot;操作系统&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么 / 不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 按&quot;思想根基 → 国防总论 → 安全观 → 战争形态&quot;四章组织，从历史思想脉络一路推进到智能化战争前沿：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>主要内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>军事思想</td>\n<td>中国军事文化从何而来</td>\n<td>中国古代军事思想（《孙子兵法》）、毛泽东军事思想、习近平强军思想</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国防概述</td>\n<td>国防是什么、谁来建</td>\n<td>国防概念与历史、国防法规与政策、国防建设与武装力量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国家安全</td>\n<td>安全的内涵如何拓展</td>\n<td>总体国家安全观、国际安全形势、非传统安全威胁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现代战争</td>\n<td>当代战争怎么打</td>\n<td>新军事变革、信息化战争、智能化战争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>军事科学（11_military-science）下设三个并列 hub，分工互补，避免内容重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>军事理论</strong>（本 hub）</td>\n<td>思想 · 观念 · 战争形态</td>\n<td>为何而战、战争怎样演变</td>\n<td>提供理论框架与战略视角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>国防</strong>（2_national-defense）</td>\n<td>制度 · 法规 · 动员</td>\n<td>武装力量怎么编、兵役怎么服、平战怎么转</td>\n<td>本 hub 概述的体制，国防 hub 做专题展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>军事技术</strong>（3_military-technology）</td>\n<td>装备 · 技术 · 武器系统</td>\n<td>导弹、电子战、无人机如何工作</td>\n<td>本 hub 谈的战争形态，技术 hub 给出物质支撑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>遇到&quot;思想/形态&quot;问题看本 hub，遇到&quot;制度/编成&quot;看国防 hub，遇到&quot;装备/原理&quot;看军事技术 hub。</strong> 三者通过各篇末尾的&quot;延伸阅读与跨学科链接&quot;相互引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>面向高校军事理论课学生（必修 4 学分）</strong>：按章顺序通读即可——先用&quot;军事思想&quot;建立文化自觉，再用&quot;国防概述&quot;理解国防的法理与体制，然后用&quot;国家安全&quot;建立总体安全视野，最后用&quot;现代战争&quot;把握战争演变趋势。配合每篇的&quot;练习与思考&quot;自测。</p>\n<p><strong>面向只想快速建立战略素养的非军事专业读者</strong>：走精读路线——<a href=\"military-thought/ancient-chinese-military-thought\">中国古代军事思想</a> → <a href=\"national-security/overall-national-security-concept\">总体国家安全观</a> → <a href=\"modern-warfare/revolution-in-military-affairs\">新军事变革</a>，三篇即可建立&quot;古代智慧—当代安全观—未来战争&quot;的主干认知。</p>\n<p><strong>面向对前沿最感兴趣的科技读者</strong>：直接从<a href=\"modern-warfare/revolution-in-military-affairs\">新军事变革</a> → <a href=\"modern-warfare/informationized-warfare\">信息化战争</a> → <a href=\"modern-warfare/intelligent-warfare\">智能化战争</a>切入，再回溯思想章理解&quot;中国为何选择机械化信息化智能化融合发展道路&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>中国近现代史基础</strong>：理解&quot;近代国防屈辱&quot;&quot;人民战争&quot;&quot;强军思想&quot;都需要对鸦片战争至今的历史脉络有基本把握。</li>\n<li><strong>马克思主义基本原理</strong>：毛泽东军事思想以唯物辩证法为方法论，强军思想是马克思主义军事理论中国化的最新成果，相关篇章已给出到马克思主义 hub 的链接。</li>\n<li><strong>当代国际关系常识</strong>：国家安全与现代战争两章涉及大国竞争、地缘格局，了解基本的国际格局有助理解，相关篇章链接到政治学与地缘政治 hub。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无需任何军事专业背景，所有概念均从零讲起。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"military-thought","title":"军事思想","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/military-thought","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ancient-chinese-military-thought","title":"中国古代军事思想","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/military-thought/ancient-chinese-military-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mao-zedong-military-thought","title":"毛泽东军事思想","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/military-thought/mao-zedong-military-thought"},{"seq":3,"slug":"xi-jinping-strong-army-thought","title":"习近平强军思想","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/military-thought/xi-jinping-strong-army-thought"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"national-defense-overview","title":"中国国防","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-defense-overview","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"national-defense-concept","title":"国防概述与国防历史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-defense-overview/national-defense-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"national-defense-law","title":"国防法规与国防政策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-defense-overview/national-defense-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"national-defense-building","title":"国防建设与武装力量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-defense-overview/national-defense-building"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"national-security","title":"国家安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overall-national-security-concept","title":"总体国家安全观","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-security/overall-national-security-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"security-situation","title":"国际安全形势分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-security/security-situation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"non-traditional-security","title":"非传统安全威胁","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/national-security/non-traditional-security"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-warfare","title":"现代战争","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/modern-warfare","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"revolution-in-military-affairs","title":"新军事变革","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/modern-warfare/revolution-in-military-affairs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"informationized-warfare","title":"信息化战争","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/modern-warfare/informationized-warfare"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-warfare","title":"智能化战争","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-theory/modern-warfare/intelligent-warfare"}]}]}